# Docker build context se in paths ko exclude karo, taaki image mein local environment/secrets/data na copy hon.
# Git history aur local virtual environment container ko nahi chahiye.
.git
.venv
# Generated Python bytecode ko source build context se hatao.
__pycache__
# Local model/data include nahi honge; default app missing local model ko HF se download kar sakti hai.
models/
data/
# Local secrets image mein bake mat karo; deployment environment se values milengi.
.env
# Tests, GitHub workflow files, root README aur local metrics runtime image ke liye exclude hain.
tests/
.github/
README.md
metrics.json
